    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a cask, tun or other vessel used for holding or storing water, beer or other liquid (OED s.v. vat n.1), here as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | vat, a cask or barrel to contain dry things (OED fat, n.1 2), as a packing unit for liquid goods (vinegar) | as a packing unit of Rhine wine | vat, a cask or barrel, as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size (OED fat, n.1 2) | vat, a cask or barrel, as a packing unit for wine | vat, a cask or barrel as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | vat, a cask or barrel to contain dry things (OED fat, n.1 2), as a packing unit | vat, a cask or barrel to contain dry goods (OED fat, n.1 2), here as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | of flax | of woad | vat as a packing unit | vat, a cask or barrel to contain dry things (OED fat, n.1 2), as a packing unit of no particular size | vat, a cask or barrel to contain dry goods (OED fat, n.1 2), as a packing unit | vat, a cask or barrel to contain dry goods (OED fat, n.1 2), here as a packing unit of no particular size | for dry goods | as a packing unit for liquid goods | vat, as a packing unit for liquid goods | vat, a cask or barrel to contain dry goods (OED fat, n.1 2), here as a packing unit for liquid goods of no particular size | small vat as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | of argell (argull) (q.v.) | of liquid goods, not wine | as a packing unit for dry goods | half vat, as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | vat, a cask or barrel to contain liquid goods (OED fat, n.1 2) | of eels | vat as a packing unit for liquid goods</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
